{"4897790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of ClaudeCraft", "steam_appid": 4897790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of ClaudeCraft is a classic-style micro-MMO that rebuilds the feel of the golden age of online RPGs — with an authoritative server and persistent characters, so the world is genuinely shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine classic classes done faithfully (Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Rogue, Priest, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) with real vanilla-era ability kits, resources and spell ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-built world with a story: begin in Eastbrook Vale and follow the Gravecaller conspiracy north through Mirefen Marsh and up into Thornpeak Heights — three zones, ~60 quests, vendors, rare spawns, living overworld AI. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up for 5-player elite dungeons: the Hollow Crypt, the Sunken Bastion, the moon-cult Drowned Temple, and the Gravewyrm Sanctum finale — multi-phase bosses, add waves, class-split blue and epic loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with and against others: parties of five with shared quest credit and real group XP bonuses, atomic player trading, friendly duels, and the Ashen Coliseum ranked 1v1 arena with persistent Elo and a live ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic to the core: real classic-era formulas (armor DR, spell-hit tables with the level cliff, XP curve, rage conversion). Everything procedurally rendered and synthesized — timber towns, torch-lit crypts, animated water, painted spell icons, a full WebAudio soundscape, no stock assets.<br><br>The world is getting bigger by the day. Join the community!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of ClaudeCraft is a classic-style micro-MMO that rebuilds the feel of the golden age of online RPGs — with an authoritative server and persistent characters, so the world is genuinely shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine classic classes done faithfully (Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Rogue, Priest, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) with real vanilla-era ability kits, resources and spell ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-built world with a story: begin in Eastbrook Vale and follow the Gravecaller conspiracy north through Mirefen Marsh and up into Thornpeak Heights — three zones, ~60 quests, vendors, rare spawns, living overworld AI. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up for 5-player elite dungeons: the Hollow Crypt, the Sunken Bastion, the moon-cult Drowned Temple, and the Gravewyrm Sanctum finale — multi-phase bosses, add waves, class-split blue and epic loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with and against others: parties of five with shared quest credit and real group XP bonuses, atomic player trading, friendly duels, and the Ashen Coliseum ranked 1v1 arena with persistent Elo and a live ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic to the core: real classic-era formulas (armor DR, spell-hit tables with the level cliff, XP curve, rage conversion). Everything procedurally rendered and synthesized — timber towns, torch-lit crypts, animated water, painted spell icons, a full WebAudio soundscape, no stock assets.<br><br>The world is getting bigger by the day. Join the community!</p>", "short_description": "A classic-style micro-MMO: nine vanilla-flavored classes, real classic-era combat formulas, a hand-built quest world across three zones, 5-player elite dungeons, a ranked 1v1 arena, parties, trading and duels — on an authoritative server with persistent characters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati